I would like to congratulate the authors for putting together such a cool piece of work. Personally, I think that we are only starting to grasp the potential of 3D-aware generative models and this paper is a step in the right direction in my opinion. I would like to bring up to the authors that there seems to be a missing reference to relevant related work which uses a StyleGAN-like architecture in the generator and also "renders" feature maps that are then processed by a small convolutional block to produce the final RGB outputs. 

